-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 10.1.2008 (הסתדרות המורים) — יישום שלב א' ברפורמה
-- במערכת החינוך: a first and temporary stage of the reform, between the
-- State and הסתדרות המורים, for the teaching employees of the State whom
-- the reform's terms do not yet reach. Whom it covers (§2); the wage
-- supplement for an individual teaching hour — 4.5% from 1.1.08 for one
-- weekly hour, 8.5% from 1.1.09 for two — on the combined salary, תוספת
-- 94' and תוספת 2001 (§3(א)); fewer individual hours at a part-time
-- position, by (ב)'s table; paid by the position, not beyond 100% (ג);
-- what it counts for (ד); provident contributions left to the
-- comprehensive negotiation (ה); the individual hour as the reform
-- agreement defines it (ו); the principals' further hour and the
-- kindergarten teachers' ten minutes (ט); the supplement stops after the
-- salary of June 2008 unless the parties reach a comprehensive reform
-- agreement by then (י); exhaustion of claims (§4) and the follow-up
-- committee (§5).
--
-- THE REFORM AGREEMENT of 10.9.2007
-- (l4/agreements/ofek-hadash/2007-09-10_ofek-hadash_reform-founding-agreement.l4)
-- is imported for the individual hour (its §14(ג)) and its day of signing.
-- The agreement of 24.2.2008
-- (l4/agreements/teachers-general/2008-02-24_pre-ofek_stage-a-amendment-part-time.l4,
-- which imports this file) puts a new table in place of §3(ב) from
-- 1.2.08; the rules here are the agreement as signed. The parallel stage A
-- of ארגון המורים, for post-primary education, is §5 of its agreement of
-- 24.1.2008 (l4/agreements/oz-latmura/2008-01-24_oz-latmura_tosefet-sachar_reform-model.l4).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT collective_agreements_law
IMPORT `2007-09-10_ofek-hadash_reform-founding-agreement`

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: the individual
-- hour and the part-time position (75%) the supplement turns on are hours
-- inside the teacher's position, paid by a supplement on it; the
-- agreement sets no working day, week or overtime, and the principals'
-- further hour and the kindergarten teachers' ten minutes are work the
-- supplement pays for, not hours the law counts.

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — יישום שלב א' ברפורמה במערכת החינוך: תוספת שכר לעובדי ההוראה (הסתדרות המורים, 10.1.2008)`

DECLARE `Histadrut stage A action` IS ONE OF
    `include the individual hour in the teacher's work plan, under the agreement of 10.1.2008`
    `issue guidelines for the principals' further hour, under the agreement of 10.1.2008`
    `decide a dispute over the agreement of 10.1.2008`
    `convene on a party's request, under the agreement of 10.1.2008`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 A registration stamp left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 A second registration stamp: registered on 15.4.2008, its number illegible; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The first party, the State, and who represents it (the wages commissioner and the Ministry's Director-General); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The State's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 The second party, הסתדרות המורים, and its secretary-general; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 The union's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 A recital: in תשס"ח the reform's terms were applied in some of the primary and junior-high schools.
-- akn:preamble/p14 A recital: the parties set the understandings down in a collective agreement.
-- akn:preamble/p15 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

-- ¶4: the day of signing, written in by hand.
@ref akn:preamble/p4
`the agreement of 10.1.2008 was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 10 1 2008

-- ¶11: the reform agreement was signed on 10.9.07 — the founding
-- agreement (imported), which dates itself so.
@ref akn:preamble/p11
`the agreement of 10.1.2008 dates the reform agreement as it dates itself` MEANS
    `the signing date` EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 10 9 2007

#ASSERT `the agreement of 10.1.2008 dates the reform agreement as it dates itself`

-- ¶13: a first and temporary stage, for a limited time, for every
-- teaching employee whom the reform's terms of pay and employment do not
-- reach, save those §2 lists.
@ref akn:preamble/p13
`stage A of 10.1.2008 is temporary` MEANS TRUE

§§ `1 המבוא`

@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p1
`the agreement of 10.1.2008's preamble is part of it` MEANS TRUE

§§ `2 תחולה`

DECLARE `Histadrut stage A post` IS ONE OF
    `a teacher, for the agreement of 10.1.2008`
    `a principal, for the agreement of 10.1.2008`
    `a kindergarten teacher, for the agreement of 10.1.2008`

@desc A teaching employee, as far as the agreement of 10.1.2008 asks.
DECLARE `Histadrut stage A teacher` HAS
    `in the teaching scale, for 10.1.2008`              IS A BOOLEAN @desc מדורג בדירוג עובדי הוראה
    `employed in the State's service, for 10.1.2008`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `on the reform's terms, for 10.1.2008`              IS A BOOLEAN @desc the pay and employment terms of the reform agreement, or of a comprehensive reform agreement, are applied to him
    `all his post is guidance, for 10.1.2008`           IS A BOOLEAN @desc כל תפקידו בהדרכה
    `in an ulpan or adult education, for 10.1.2008`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `a supervisor, for 10.1.2008`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `chose not to move to the reform in a reform school, for 10.1.2008` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the post, for 10.1.2008`                           IS A `Histadrut stage A post`
    `the position, for 10.1.2008`                       IS A NUMBER  @desc the position share, 1 for a full position
    `does the work of the step of 1.1.08`               IS A BOOLEAN @desc the individual hours, or the substitute work of (ט), the step from 1.1.08 asks of him
    `does the work of the step of 1.1.09`               IS A BOOLEAN @desc the individual hours, or the substitute work of (ט), the step from 1.1.09 asks of him
    `combined salary of a full position, for 10.1.2008` IS A NUMBER
    `supplement 94 of a full position, for 10.1.2008`   IS A NUMBER  @desc תוספת 94'
    `supplement 2001 of a full position, for 10.1.2008` IS A NUMBER

-- (א)(1)–(4): the employees it leaves out, any one of them (convention
-- reading.lists: each item is its own exception).
@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_4
GIVEN t IS A `Histadrut stage A teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `left out of the agreement of 10.1.2008` t IF
        t's `all his post is guidance, for 10.1.2008`
    OR t's `in an ulpan or adult education, for 10.1.2008`
    OR t's `a supervisor, for 10.1.2008`
    OR t's `chose not to move to the reform in a reform school, for 10.1.2008`

-- (א): every employee in the teaching scale employed in the State's
-- service whom the reform agreement's terms, or a comprehensive reform
-- agreement's, do not reach, save (1)–(4); ¶2: they are "עובדי הוראה" for
-- the agreement. The one employer that signs it is the State, so it is a
-- special collective agreement, and it reaches its employees of the kinds
-- it includes (the Collective Agreements Law, §15, imported).
@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2__para_a akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN t IS A `Histadrut stage A teacher`
GIVETH AN `employee a collective agreement may reach`
DECIDE `the agreement of 10.1.2008's teacher, as the law asks` t IS
    `employee a collective agreement may reach` WITH
        `his employer is a party to the agreement`  IS t's `employed in the State's service, for 10.1.2008`
        `his employer is represented for it by an employers' organisation that is a party` IS FALSE
        `his employer was or became a member of an employers' organisation that is a party` IS FALSE
        `his employer was expressly left out of the agreement` IS FALSE
        `he is of a kind of employee the agreement includes` IS
                t's `in the teaching scale, for 10.1.2008`
            AND NOT t's `on the reform's terms, for 10.1.2008`
        `he is in an occupation or post the agreement includes` IS NOT `left out of the agreement of 10.1.2008` t

GIVEN t IS A `Histadrut stage A teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement of 10.1.2008 applies to` t IF
    `a special collective agreement applies to the employee` (`the agreement of 10.1.2008's teacher, as the law asks` t)

§§ `3 יישום שלב א' ברפורמה במערכת החינוך`

-- (א): the supplement comes in two steps: from 1.1.08, and from 1.1.09
-- (convention dates.start: each day is in its step). 0 before the first.
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the step of the agreement of 10.1.2008 on` d IS
    BRANCH IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2009) THEN 2
           IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2008) THEN 1
           OTHERWISE 0

-- (א)(1): from 1.1.08, one weekly individual hour, and 4.5% (ארבעה וחצי
-- אחוז) on the combined salary, תוספת 94' and תוספת 2001; (א)(2): from
-- 1.1.09, two weekly individual hours, and 4% more: 8.5% in all. A
-- teacher who does the first step's work alone after 1.1.09 keeps (1)'s
-- 4.5%: (2) completes it for the second hour, and takes nothing away.
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3__para_a akn:art_3__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_3__para_a__subpara_2
GIVEN t IS A `Histadrut stage A teacher`, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the stage A rate of 10.1.2008` t d IS
    BRANCH IF `the step of the agreement of 10.1.2008 on` d EQUALS 2 AND t's `does the work of the step of 1.1.09` THEN 8.5%
           IF `the step of the agreement of 10.1.2008 on` d AT LEAST 1 AND t's `does the work of the step of 1.1.08` THEN 4.5%
           OTHERWISE 0

`the base of the stage A supplement of 10.1.2008` MEANS "השכר המשולב, תוספת 94' ותוספת 2001"

GIVEN t IS A `Histadrut stage A teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the stage A base of 10.1.2008` t IS
    t's `combined salary of a full position, for 10.1.2008`
    PLUS t's `supplement 94 of a full position, for 10.1.2008`
    PLUS t's `supplement 2001 of a full position, for 10.1.2008`

-- The individual hours a step asks: how many, and whether a week or a
-- month. (ב)'s table counts some by the week and some by the month, and
-- the encoding does not convert the one to the other.
@desc The individual hours a step of stage A asks of a teacher.
DECLARE `Histadrut stage A individual hours` HAS
    `individual hours, for stage A of the Histadrut` IS A NUMBER
    `counted by the week, for stage A of the Histadrut` IS A BOOLEAN @desc TRUE for hours a week, FALSE for hours a month

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER, `by the week` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Histadrut stage A individual hours`
DECIDE `stage A individual hours of` n `by the week` IS
    `Histadrut stage A individual hours` WITH
        `individual hours, for stage A of the Histadrut` IS n
        `counted by the week, for stage A of the Histadrut` IS `by the week`

-- (ב): (א) is about a teacher at a position of 75% or more; at a smaller
-- position, fewer individual hours, by the table: 50%–74%, two hours a
-- month from 1.1.08 and one hour a week from 1.1.09; 25%–49%, one hour a
-- month and two hours a month. The rows meet at 50% and at 75%, and a
-- position between 74% and 75% is in the row below 75% (conventions
-- thresholds.loose and thresholds.shared-bound). Under 25% the table
-- prints no row, and none is made up (convention thresholds.missing-row;
-- finding F-hh-stage-a-a).
@ref akn:art_3__para_b akn:art_3__para_b/t1
GIVEN step IS A NUMBER, share IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `Histadrut stage A individual hours`
DECIDE `the individual hours (ב) of 10.1.2008 asks` step share IS
    BRANCH IF step EQUALS 0 THEN NOTHING
           IF share `has reached the row from` 0.75 THEN JUST (`stage A individual hours of` step TRUE)
           IF share `is in the row from` 0.5 `to` 0.75 AND step EQUALS 1 THEN JUST (`stage A individual hours of` 2 FALSE)
           IF share `is in the row from` 0.5 `to` 0.75 THEN JUST (`stage A individual hours of` 1 TRUE)
           IF share `is in the row from` 0.25 `to` 0.5 THEN JUST (`stage A individual hours of` step FALSE)
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

GIVEN share IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE `Histadrut stage A individual hours`
DECIDE `the individual hours stage A asks, as signed on 10.1.2008` share d IS
    `the individual hours (ב) of 10.1.2008 asks` (`the step of the agreement of 10.1.2008 on` d) share

-- F-hh-stage-a-a: the table stops at 25%, and (ב) says (א) applies to the
-- smaller positions "בשינויים הבאים" — the table's. Of a position under
-- 25% the agreement says neither that it is out nor what it asks.
`(ב)'s table has no row under a position of 25%` MEANS
        `the individual hours stage A asks, as signed on 10.1.2008` 0.25 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2008) EQUALS JUST (`stage A individual hours of` 1 FALSE)
    AND `the individual hours stage A asks, as signed on 10.1.2008` 0.2 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2008) EQUALS NOTHING
    AND `the individual hours stage A asks, as signed on 10.1.2008` 0.2 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2009) EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `(ב)'s table has no row under a position of 25%`

`why the agreement of 10.1.2008 says nothing of a position under 25%` MEANS
    `the text is silent` "F-hh-stage-a-a"

-- (ט): for a principal, a further hour of work beyond the hours of his
-- position, to organise, run and check the individual hours, by the
-- Ministry's guidelines; for a kindergarten teacher, ten minutes more at
-- the end of every school day, beyond the end the takanon sets today.
-- What a post does in place of the individual hours.
DECLARE `Histadrut stage A work` IS ONE OF
    `the individual hours of (ב)'s table, for the agreement of 10.1.2008`
    `a further hour of work beyond the position, to organise the individual hours`
    `ten more minutes at the end of every school day, for the agreement of 10.1.2008`

-- F-hh-stage-a-b: (ט) puts one substitute "במקום ביצוע שעת הוראה
-- פרטנית" — one further hour, ten minutes a day — and says nothing of the
-- second step, where (א)(2) asks the teacher a second weekly hour, nor of
-- a part-time position, where (ב) asks fewer. Read as printed: the same
-- substitute at both steps and every position (convention
-- reading.as-printed).
@ref akn:art_3__para_i akn:art_3__para_i__subpara_1 akn:art_3__para_i__subpara_2
GIVEN p IS A `Histadrut stage A post`, step IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Histadrut stage A work`
DECIDE `the work stage A of 10.1.2008 asks of` p step IS
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `a principal, for the agreement of 10.1.2008` THEN `a further hour of work beyond the position, to organise the individual hours`
    WHEN `a kindergarten teacher, for the agreement of 10.1.2008` THEN `ten more minutes at the end of every school day, for the agreement of 10.1.2008`
    OTHERWISE `the individual hours of (ב)'s table, for the agreement of 10.1.2008`

`the further hour of a principal under the agreement of 10.1.2008` MEANS 1
`the minutes the agreement of 10.1.2008 adds to a kindergarten teacher's school day` MEANS 10

`the principals' further hour under the agreement of 10.1.2008` MEANS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MAY   `issue guidelines for the principals' further hour, under the agreement of 10.1.2008`

`(ט) keeps one substitute while (א)(2) doubles the teacher's hour` MEANS
        `the individual hours stage A asks, as signed on 10.1.2008` 1 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2009) EQUALS JUST (`stage A individual hours of` 2 TRUE)
    AND `the individual hours stage A asks, as signed on 10.1.2008` 1 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2008) EQUALS JUST (`stage A individual hours of` 1 TRUE)
    AND `the work stage A of 10.1.2008 asks of` `a principal, for the agreement of 10.1.2008` 2 EQUALS `the work stage A of 10.1.2008 asks of` `a principal, for the agreement of 10.1.2008` 1
    AND `the work stage A of 10.1.2008 asks of` `a kindergarten teacher, for the agreement of 10.1.2008` 2 EQUALS `the work stage A of 10.1.2008 asks of` `a kindergarten teacher, for the agreement of 10.1.2008` 1

#ASSERT `(ט) keeps one substitute while (א)(2) doubles the teacher's hour`

-- (י): the supplement goes on after the salary of June 2008 only if the
-- parties reach a comprehensive reform agreement by then — the salary
-- month itself, to its last day (conventions dates.salary-month and
-- dates.end); if not, it stops, and so does the weekly individual hour.
-- The day an agreement was reached is an input: the agreement was signed
-- before it.
@ref akn:art_3__para_j
GIVEN `the day a comprehensive reform agreement was reached` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a comprehensive reform agreement was reached by the salary of June 2008` `the day a comprehensive reform agreement was reached` IF
    CONSIDER `the day a comprehensive reform agreement was reached`
    WHEN JUST day THEN day `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2008)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

GIVEN d IS A DATE, `the day a comprehensive reform agreement was reached` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `stage A of 10.1.2008 goes on in the salary month of` d `the day a comprehensive reform agreement was reached` IF
        d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2008)
    OR `a comprehensive reform agreement was reached by the salary of June 2008` `the day a comprehensive reform agreement was reached`

-- (ג): paid by the teacher's position, but not beyond 100%: the text sets
-- the ceiling that convention position.above-full waits for. The
-- supplement of a salary month, where the agreement reaches the teacher
-- and stage A goes on; NOTHING where the text is silent (a teacher under
-- 25%, F-hh-stage-a-a).
@ref akn:art_3__para_c
GIVEN t IS A `Histadrut stage A teacher`, d IS A DATE, `the day a comprehensive reform agreement was reached` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the stage A supplement of 10.1.2008` t d `the day a comprehensive reform agreement was reached` IS
    IF `the agreement of 10.1.2008 applies to` t
       AND `stage A of 10.1.2008 goes on in the salary month of` d `the day a comprehensive reform agreement was reached`
    THEN (IF t's `the post, for 10.1.2008` EQUALS `a teacher, for the agreement of 10.1.2008`
             AND t's `the position, for 10.1.2008` LESS THAN 0.25
          THEN NOTHING
          ELSE JUST (((`the stage A base of 10.1.2008` t) `pro rata to a position of` (min (t's `the position, for 10.1.2008`) 1)) TIMES `the stage A rate of 10.1.2008` t d))
    ELSE JUST 0

DECLARE `what the stage A supplement of 10.1.2008 might count for` IS ONE OF
    `percentage supplements on the combined salary, of the stage A supplement of 10.1.2008`
    `the hour value, of the stage A supplement of 10.1.2008`

-- (ד): counted for the percentage supplements computed on the combined
-- salary, and not for the value of an hour.
@ref akn:art_3__para_d
GIVEN p IS A `what the stage A supplement of 10.1.2008 might count for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the stage A supplement of 10.1.2008 counts for` p IF
    p EQUALS `percentage supplements on the combined salary, of the stage A supplement of 10.1.2008`

-- (ה): the provident-fund contributions on the supplement (retroactively,
-- within the tax year) are to be agreed in the negotiation on the
-- comprehensive reform agreement: the agreement gives no answer of its own.
@ref akn:art_3__para_e
`why the agreement of 10.1.2008 sets no provident contributions on its supplement` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "המשא ומתן על הסכם הרפורמה הכולל (סעיף 3(ה))"

-- (ו): "שעת הוראה פרטנית" is as §14(ג) of the reform agreement means it:
-- with a group of up to 5 pupils or with one pupil (imported).
@ref akn:art_3__para_f
GIVEN pupils IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an individual teaching hour's group under the agreement of 10.1.2008` pupils IF
    `a group for individual hours` pupils

#ASSERT `an individual teaching hour's group under the agreement of 10.1.2008` 1
#ASSERT NOT `an individual teaching hour's group under the agreement of 10.1.2008` 6

-- (ז): the individual hour is part of the teacher's work plan. The plan
-- is the school's, and the reform agreement's §14(ג) gives the content of
-- the individual hours to the principal: he is the one who includes it.
@ref akn:art_3__para_g
`the individual hour in the work plan, under the agreement of 10.1.2008` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `include the individual hour in the teacher's work plan, under the agreement of 10.1.2008`

-- (ח): the individual hour does not change the teacher's position, nor
-- take from it.
@ref akn:art_3__para_h
GIVEN share IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position with the individual hour of 10.1.2008` share IS share

#ASSERT `the position with the individual hour of 10.1.2008` 0.8 EQUALS 0.8

-- (יא): the work the supplement is given for reflects no value of an hour
-- of work as the reform agreement agreed it and the comprehensive
-- agreement will set it.
@ref akn:art_3__para_ja
`the individual hour of 10.1.2008 reflects the reform's value of an hour` MEANS FALSE

§§ `4 מיצוי תביעות`

-- A full and final exhaustion of the parties' claims on the matters the
-- agreement settles.
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4/p1
GIVEN `on a matter this agreement settled` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement of 10.1.2008 exhausts the claim` `on a matter this agreement settled` IF
    `on a matter this agreement settled`

§§ `5 יישוב חילוקי דעות`

-- A joint parity follow-up committee — the wages commissioner, the
-- union's secretary-general and the Ministry's Director-General — follows
-- the agreement and decides unanimously disputes over its reading or
-- applying; it meets within 21 days of a party's turning to it.
@ref akn:art_5 akn:art_5/p1
`deciding disputes over the agreement of 10.1.2008` MEANS
    PARTY `the parity committee`
    MAY   `decide a dispute over the agreement of 10.1.2008`

`the committee of 10.1.2008 meets` MEANS
    PARTY `the parity committee`
    MUST  `convene on a party's request, under the agreement of 10.1.2008`
    WITHIN 21

GIVEN `members for` IS A NUMBER, `members` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the committee of 10.1.2008 decides` `members for` `members` IF
    `members for` EQUALS `members`

#ASSERT NOT `the committee of 10.1.2008 decides` 2 3

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 The signing formula; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/t1 The parties signing; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p3 The file number (שכ. 2007-8890); no rule.

§§ `examples`

-- A teacher of the State off the reform, at a given position and salary;
-- round placeholders: combined salary 8,000, תוספת 94' 500, תוספת 2001
-- 300, so the base is 8,800 for a full position.
GIVEN post IS A `Histadrut stage A post`, share IS A NUMBER, `first step` IS A BOOLEAN, `second step` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Histadrut stage A teacher`
DECIDE `a stage A teacher of 10.1.2008` post share `first step` `second step` IS
    `a stage A teacher of 10.1.2008, reform and supervision` post share `first step` `second step` FALSE FALSE

GIVEN post IS A `Histadrut stage A post`, share IS A NUMBER, `first step` IS A BOOLEAN, `second step` IS A BOOLEAN
      `on the reform` IS A BOOLEAN, `supervises` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Histadrut stage A teacher`
DECIDE `a stage A teacher of 10.1.2008, reform and supervision` post share `first step` `second step` `on the reform` `supervises` IS
    `Histadrut stage A teacher` WITH
        `in the teaching scale, for 10.1.2008`              IS TRUE
        `employed in the State's service, for 10.1.2008`    IS TRUE
        `on the reform's terms, for 10.1.2008`              IS `on the reform`
        `all his post is guidance, for 10.1.2008`           IS FALSE
        `in an ulpan or adult education, for 10.1.2008`     IS FALSE
        `a supervisor, for 10.1.2008`                       IS `supervises`
        `chose not to move to the reform in a reform school, for 10.1.2008` IS FALSE
        `the post, for 10.1.2008`                           IS post
        `the position, for 10.1.2008`                       IS share
        `does the work of the step of 1.1.08`               IS `first step`
        `does the work of the step of 1.1.09`               IS `second step`
        `combined salary of a full position, for 10.1.2008` IS 8000
        `supplement 94 of a full position, for 10.1.2008`   IS 500
        `supplement 2001 of a full position, for 10.1.2008` IS 300

